---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Services" lang="en">
  
<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative h-[614px] flex items-center overflow-hidden bg-primary-container">

<div class="relative z-10 px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto w-full">
<div class="max-w-2xl">
<span class="font-label-md text-secondary-fixed bg-on-secondary-fixed-variant/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6 inline-block">PROFESJONALIZM I JAKOŚĆ</span>
<h1 class="font-display text-display text-on-primary mb-6">Nasze Usługi</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-primary-fixed-dim max-w-xl">
                        Kompleksowe wsparcie techniczne w zakresie spawalnictwa, badań nieniszczących oraz ochrony antykorozyjnej dla przemysłu ciężkiego i energetyki.
                    </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 p-margin-desktop hidden lg:block">
<div class="w-64 h-64 border border-outline-variant/20 industrial-grid opacity-20"></div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Main Pillars -->
<section class="py-24 px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-gutter">
<!-- Pillar 1: Welding -->
<div class="group grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center border-b border-outline-variant pb-16">
<div class="md:col-span-5">
<div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant group-hover:border-primary transition-colors">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="A high-precision close-up of a professional robotic welding arm in a modern industrial factory setting. The lighting is focused, highlighting the blue electrical arc and sparks against a deep navy background. The overall aesthetic is clean, technological, and precise, matching a professional engineering brand identity with metallic textures and industrial atmosphere." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCozDnJai0fc5h24His7_lwuuvRkWNw7ycEntToxRTQvtqihRfEzRqgqf9dkI9NuXpMLgVWdHjLSYsns1jsacdBgfQFRgdEslR605HA0H65G9DYwgS-8YehgjaxGWEWBz1yHb-6dtWQ8no6mXE8xH6tKBApAcTuOZ0oEnrcWAzF2Bn-Fr21IqvEPbl2ReUaDnlz7vMN1dP5upquIj9c3ofTTr4jaGCMnZU3dePX71czqNmU_wxU-a9rgymTke6XBiR6XrstC1w2Rdw"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="md:col-span-7">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-outline-variant group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-primary-fixed transition-all">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="precision_manufacturing">precision_manufacturing</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg">Spawalnictwo i technika spawalnicza</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8">
                            Oferujemy profesjonalną koordynację prac spawalniczych oraz dobór parametrów technologicznych. Nasze działania gwarantują pełną zgodność z międzynarodowymi normami jakościowymi.
                        </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary" data-icon="check_circle">check_circle</span>
<div>
<h4 class="font-label-md text-on-surface">ISO 3834</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Pełna zgodność z wymaganiami jakościowymi.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary" data-icon="check_circle">check_circle</span>
<div>
<h4 class="font-label-md text-on-surface">EN 1090</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Nadzór nad wykonaniem konstrukcji stalowych.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Pillar 2: NDT -->
<div class="group grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center border-b border-outline-variant py-16">
<div class="md:col-span-7 order-2 md:order-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-outline-variant group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-primary-fixed transition-all">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="visibility">visibility</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg">Badania Nieniszczące (NDT)</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8">
                            Zapewniamy najwyższą jakość inspekcji poprzez zastosowanie nowoczesnych metod badawczych. Nasz zespół certyfikowanych inspektorów dostarcza precyzyjne wyniki analizy stanu technicznego.
                        </p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
<span class="px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container rounded-full font-label-md border border-outline-variant hover:border-secondary transition-colors">VT - Wizualne</span>
<span class="px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container rounded-full font-label-md border border-outline-variant hover:border-secondary transition-colors">PT - Penetracyjne</span>
<span class="px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container rounded-full font-label-md border border-outline-variant hover:border-secondary transition-colors">MT - Magnetyczno-proszkowe</span>
<span class="px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container rounded-full font-label-md border border-outline-variant hover:border-secondary transition-colors">UT - Ultradźwiękowe</span>
<span class="px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container rounded-full font-label-md border border-outline-variant hover:border-secondary transition-colors">RT - Radiograficzne</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="md:col-span-5 order-1 md:order-2">
<div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant group-hover:border-primary transition-colors">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="A technician in professional workwear performing an ultrasonic NDT test on a large industrial pipe. The scene is shot in a clean, high-tech industrial environment with soft cinematic lighting. The focus is on the digital display of the testing device showing signal waves, conveying a sense of technical mastery and rigorous quality control." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBiXAjSIZ2Sx4bzg-ixVU_9hz-Nm-s-J1guXXWxOxhSWJ-RRs20uPlilpsBEoewY8135SWb61pm7XwOM8wJMItSvMQpDzBNikg19YBxc258crE1R76VZK05gvnFwYYNrS_z66QTxozr1248L8d1Ce121fwDfYwVIIP1rr2BCPpmUWlyMNe9ytDtxipzc4MwWUoUj_2-G4KZb_uR3BGoVs8L37Ne_gd_JguV-sv8Iok8E2NuPxy57J4RvYQ9VjaXmnau8VUYhH0TP5c"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Pillar 3: Corrosion Protection -->
<div class="group grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center py-16">
<div class="md:col-span-5">
<div class="aspect-video bg-surface-container rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant group-hover:border-primary transition-colors">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="A macro shot of a perfectly coated industrial surface with a uniform texture. In the background, professional sandblasting and coating equipment is visible but slightly out of focus. The color palette is dominated by dark navy and metallic grays, with emerald green light accents reflecting off the smooth, protected surface. The mood is clean and protective." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuABap20BLW8zpycwbgSO4PU0zDQ7T_PH7mG7PYFOE7LiL2VY1YWkX8SO5icChz0-5JP91KQvcTeHWW-hqpUjQSAfe7uQVtZN55b36v-uNWGdKcnhUc7ZRkkdVBrDB-Z9RjQPCGd2uJeDY_XqnNOqjchK-wHrH6uifs9rh6Uk-BKabjpm062nV46zndmmgqKfPayjd123qp1ZbycCdpRlmnxSlfxA2YQnvuy8ruC6ek16WgAew_EcHVULDO9_mu5G4i-Ed7HGNeWJg0"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="md:col-span-7">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-outline-variant group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-primary-fixed transition-all">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="layers">layers</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg">Ochrona Antykorozyjna</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8">
                            Kompleksowy nadzór nad przygotowaniem powierzchni oraz procesem nakładania powłok malarskich. Gwarantujemy długowieczność konstrukcji w najbardziej wymagających środowiskach korozyjnych.
                        </p>
<ul class="space-y-3">
<li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-body-md text-on-surface">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-secondary rounded-full"></span>
                                Kontrola czystości podłoża i profilu chropowatości
                            </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-body-md text-on-surface">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-secondary rounded-full"></span>
                                Pomiary warunków klimatycznych podczas aplikacji
                            </li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-body-md text-on-surface">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-secondary rounded-full"></span>
                                Weryfikacja grubości powłok i przyczepności
                            </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Technical Support Section (Bento Grid) -->
<section class="bg-surface-container-low py-24">
<div class="px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto">
<div class="text-center mb-16">
<h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg mb-4">Obszary Wsparcia Technicznego</h2>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">Dodatkowe kompetencje wspierające realizację kluczowych projektów inżynieryjnych.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
<!-- QA/QC -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-4 text-secondary" data-icon="verified">verified</span>
<h3 class="font-display text-headline-sm mb-2">QA/QC</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Zapewnienie i kontrola jakości na każdym etapie produkcji.</p>
</div>
<!-- QS/QM -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-4 text-secondary" data-icon="rule">rule</span>
<h3 class="font-display text-headline-sm mb-2">QS/QM</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Systemowe zarządzanie bezpieczeństwem i jakością.</p>
</div>
<!-- Documentation -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-4 text-secondary" data-icon="description">description</span>
<h3 class="font-display text-headline-sm mb-2">Documentation</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Kompletne opracowanie dokumentacji powykonawczej.</p>
</div>
<!-- Engineering -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-4 text-secondary" data-icon="engineering">engineering</span>
<h3 class="font-display text-headline-sm mb-2">Engineering</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Wsparcie inżynieryjne przy optymalizacji procesów.</p>
</div>
<!-- Project Coordination -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl mb-4 text-secondary" data-icon="account_tree">account_tree</span>
<h3 class="font-display text-headline-sm mb-2">Coordination</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Zarządzanie terminami i koordynacja międzybranżowa.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- CTA Section -->
<section class="py-24 px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto text-center">
<div class="bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-2xl p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute inset-0 industrial-grid opacity-10"></div>
<div class="relative z-10">
<h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg mb-6">Potrzebujesz ekspertyzy technicznej?</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-primary-fixed-dim mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">Skontaktuj się z nami, aby omówić wymagania Twojego projektu i otrzymać indywidualną wycenę.</p>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
<button class="bg-secondary text-on-secondary px-8 py-4 rounded font-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-all">Zapytaj o ofertę</button>
<button class="border border-on-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded font-label-md hover:bg-on-primary hover:text-primary transition-all">Nasze realizacje</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</Layout>
